  <text>
      <body>
         <div type="performance_playbill" rend="align(center)">
            <ab>Theatre-Royal, Hay-Market.<lb/>
               This Evening, <date when="1811-09-28">Saturday, September 28, 1811</date><lb/>
               Will be perform'd a Comedy call'd<lb/>
               <bibl><title>She Stoops to Conquer.</title></bibl><lb/>
               <castList>
                  <castItem><role>Mr. Hardcastle,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Munden</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Sir Charles Marlow,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Grove</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Hastings,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">R. Jones</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Young Marlow,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Jones</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Landlord,</role> <actor>Mr. Smith.</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Muggins,</role> <actor>Mr. Lewes.</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Twist,</role> <actor>Mr. Finn.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Diggory,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Noble</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Jeremy,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Minton</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Roger,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Widdicombe</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Tony Lumpkin,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Mallinson</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Mrs. Hardcastle,</role> <actor>Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Grove</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Miss Hardcastle,</role> <actor>Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Gibbs</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Miss Neville,</role> <actor>Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Smith</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
               </castList>
               After which <hi rend="allcaps">(Sixth Time) A New Farce</hi>, in Two Acts, call'd<lb/>
               <bibl><title><quote>"Darkness Visible."</quote></title></bibl><lb/>
               With New Scenery, Dresses, and Decorations,<lb/>
               <castList>
                  <head>The Characters by</head>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Elliston</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Jones</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Russell</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Grove</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Cooper</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Noble</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Finn</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Minton</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Widdicombe</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Gray</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Munden</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Miss <hi rend="allcaps">De Camp</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Miss <hi rend="allcaps">Watson</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Minton</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
               </castList>
               The Doors to be Open'd at <time when="17:30:00">Half past Five o'Clock</time>, and the Performance to begin<lb/>
               at <time when="18:30:00">Half past Six</time>, precisely, for the remainder of the Season.<lb/>
               <hi rend="allcaps">First Price. Second Price.</hi><lb/>
               <hi rend="allcaps">Boxes</hi>,---<measure type="currency">Six Shillings</measure>. - <measure type="currency">Three Shillings</measure>.<lb/>
               <hi rend="allcaps">Pit</hi>,---<measure type="currency">Three Shillings</measure>. - <measure type="currency">One Shilling and Sixpence</measure>.<lb/>
               <hi rend="allcaps">First Gallery</hi>, <measure type="currency">Two Shillings</measure>. - <measure type="currency">One Shilling</measure>.<lb/>
               <hi rend="allcaps">Upper Gallery</hi>, <measure type="currency">One Shilling</measure>. - <measure type="currency">Sixpence</measure>.<lb/>
               Places for the Boxes to be taken of Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Massingham</hi> at the Theatre.<lb/>
               The Publick is respectfully inform'd that the Farce of '<hi rend="allcaps">Darkness Visible</hi>' con-<lb/>
               tinuing to be honour'd with the most mark'd approbation, will be perform'd every evening<lb/>
               'till further notice.</ab>
         </div>
      </body>
  </text>
